{"3905670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Down Forward", "steam_appid": 3905670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "A free demo is coming soon — wishlist to be notified.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/76cfb051cf4deecd5b841976303cb481.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/76cfb051cf4deecd5b841976303cb481.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/76cfb051cf4deecd5b841976303cb481.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Concept</h2>Roguelike old-school FPS infused with analogue horror.<br>Descend into the 4th dimension and unravel the truth behind liminal spaces.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relevance</h2>DOWN FORWARD pushes beyond traditional old-school FPS design.<br>If you're tired of predictable layouts and familiar rules, expect something deliberately unstable and unpredictable.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/039c47e93b05317ecca141e61c4dc333.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/039c47e93b05317ecca141e61c4dc333.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/039c47e93b05317ecca141e61c4dc333.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survive swarms of increasingly odd enemies in an unstable maze-like arena.<br>The layout can shift at any moment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISK &amp; REWARD</h2><br>Slay enemies and earn XP to level up.<br>Choose from a random selection of upgrades, ranging from new weapons to powerful character buffs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Score</h2><br>Push your limits to rack up a massive high score.<br>Earn Account XP based on performance and unlock persistent perks through the skill tree.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/15545241a49dc8ba6a89f2f79c593cae.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/15545241a49dc8ba6a89f2f79c593cae.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/15545241a49dc8ba6a89f2f79c593cae.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lords of the Depths</h2><br>Find and defeat challenging bosses.<br>Each map has its own boss, reach them if you dare...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/d0f223e724f65ebb43cf074622f92753.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/d0f223e724f65ebb43cf074622f92753.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/d0f223e724f65ebb43cf074622f92753.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Tree</h2><br>Unlock permanent perks, enhance your mobility, resistance and combat abilities!<br>Make your own build and own your style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Loadout</h2><br>Master unique weapons and plan for each map.<br>With the right combination of weapons and buffs, you can transform your loadout into its ultimate form.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment</h2><br>Experiment with perk and weapon synergies to discover unexpected and powerful playstyles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/e4625bbedf062a1c1337becc7ec2ece9.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/e4625bbedf062a1c1337becc7ec2ece9.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/e4625bbedf062a1c1337becc7ec2ece9.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VHS</h2><br>Analogue horror aesthetics and atmosphere.<br>Bringing pain and violence to this unique horror space.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear and Loathing</h2><br>Heavily influenced by a wide range of horror traditions.<br>From H.P. Lovecraft to Edgar Allan Poe, the game draws from deep and varied horror roots.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by human</h2>Made with care, intention, and respect for the player.", "about_the_game": "A free demo is coming soon — wishlist to be notified.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/76cfb051cf4deecd5b841976303cb481.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/76cfb051cf4deecd5b841976303cb481.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/76cfb051cf4deecd5b841976303cb481.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"