assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/15545241a49dc8ba6a89f2f79c593cae.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lords of the Depths</h2><br>Find and defeat challenging bosses.<br>Each map has its own boss, reach them if you dare...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/d0f223e724f65ebb43cf074622f92753.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/d0f223e724f65ebb43cf074622f92753.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/d0f223e724f65ebb43cf074622f92753.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Tree</h2><br>Unlock permanent perks, enhance your mobility, resistance and combat abilities!<br>Make your own build and own your style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Loadout</h2><br>Master unique weapons and plan for each map.<br>With the right combination of weapons and buffs, you can transform your loadout into its ultimate form.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment</h2><br>Experiment with perk and weapon synergies to discover unexpected and powerful playstyles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/e4625bbedf062a1c1337becc7ec2ece9.poster.avif?t=1783439991\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/e4625bbedf062a1c1337becc7ec2ece9.webm?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/extras/e4625bbedf062a1c1337becc7ec2ece9.mp4?t=1783439991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp